<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Orray creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Orray` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. Its custom `Orray`
  BodyDef is entirely vanilla-part composition (Body/Tail/Spine/Stomach/
  Heart/Lung x2/Kidney x2/Liver/Hump/Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Ear x2/
  Nose, 2x Leg/Paw) — defName rename only, ported as RSW_Orray
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml). `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` repoint to the
  already-ported RSW_Leather_Tough/RSW_Reptomammal_Meat (no new resource
  needed). Its Odyssey specialTrainable (`SW_Spur`) repoints to the
  already-ported RSW_SW_Spur (RSW_MlieWaveB_Abilities.xml, ported alongside
  Kybuck, Pass 16). Adult lifeStage sounds repoint to the already-absorbed
  sound wave (RSW_Pawn_Orray_*, 2026-09-02). No `canCrossBreedWith` (donor
  sets none, and no already-ported species lists bare `Orray` either).

  `OrrayArtOverride` (mandrake.rsw.orrayartoverride) covers the base
  `Orray_{south,east,north}` facing across all life stages (one shared
  texPath) — texPaths stay unchanged text, so the override binds
  automatically. Only `Orray_Dessicated` was extracted this pass (1 PNG,
  the donor's own `OrrayPack_*` pack-saddle variants excluded, unreferenced
  by the def) via extract_bundle.py against the same AssetBundle every
  prior wave used. Sits at Textures/swanimals/Orray/.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: ZBiome_Grasslands (per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row for this species), repointed from the
  bare "Orray" entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
